			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 761800401,
					"content": "以前都是到桑多涅的庭院去聚会，现在换成桑多涅你到我的庭院来喝茶，感觉真新奇。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761800402
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761800402,
					"content": "但茶和茶点还是我来准备，感觉也没变多少…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761800403
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761800403,
					"content": "嗯，还是和以前一样美味。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761800404
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761800404,
					"content": "#哼。不过，听说{NICKNAME}也会经常来这边看你，你们这种时候都会干嘛？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761800405
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761800405,
					"content": "#唔…有时会聊聊天，有时会和月灵一起玩游戏，看月灵画画。哦，我还会和{M#他}{F#她}下月亮棋呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761800406
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761800406,
					"content": "「月亮棋」？就是那种三个子连成一条线的游戏？你们谁赢得多？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761800407
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761800407,
					"content": "#我没有数过，但{NICKNAME}挺会下棋的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761800408
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761800408,
					"content": "哼哼，那你是没和我玩过。要来一局吗？让你见识一下什么是真正的厉害。平局算我输。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761800409
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761800409,
					"content": "好呀。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7618006,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7618004
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_NONE",
			"beginConditions": {
